# The controls pages and the fixes of their faults (fixtures/controls:
# options' lba.cfg with GamePad: ON): the keys' page as controls.keys
# opens it. Behavior menu's first binding is cleared and its second
# refused, the pad's left shoulder holding Behavior menu, the help
# saying so. Page Down from line 17 goes ten lines on, to Default
# Configuration, where the Classic's stayed on line 17. End and Accept
# Configuration write the bindings into lba.cfg, and the menus give
# the main menu back.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot controls
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot keys
key Down Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Delete
sleep 1
shot cleared
key Right Delete
sleep 1
shot refused
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
shot line17
key Next
sleep 1
shot pagedown
key End
sleep 1
shot accept
key Return
sleep 3
shot leftkeys
key Up
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
shot options2
key Up Up Up Up Up
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
shot main
